{"/api/discogs/artist/16390/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"16390","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"Amazon II is the collaboration of Tony B & Gavin King (Aphrodite). Tony and Gavin met when they both DJ'd on Pulse FM 90.6. Pulse FM was a classic Hardcore station through the early nineties - turning a whole generation of Londoners on to the break beat sound. Pulse FM collasped in 1995 after being raided by the DTI on too many occasions. Amazon best known track to date is \"King Of The Beats\" which has been licensed to 78 countries worldwide and was No.1 in a remarkable 29 of those countries!","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:16390","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":888677,"name":"Gavin King"},{"active":true,"id":2727900,"name":"Mukesh Baboolall"}],"namevariations":["Amazon 2","AmazonⅡ"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/16390-Amazon-II","type":"artist","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/artist/1705705/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"1705705","image":"https://i.discogs.com/AcDD3Km_Qi0K8oGvulOW1InjVRD96ASkvZLZZ473-dc/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:525/w:350/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE3MDU3/MDUtMTI3MzAwMTM0/Mi5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/3WgiXdvTFpmNXHRcVBA2BSBavyuK5vtH9PW4xpoiYt4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE3MDU3/MDUtMTI3MzAwMTM0/Mi5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"Dutch hip-hop MC from Groningen, Netherlands, rapping in Dutch.\r\n\r\nBorn 1 July 1986 in Rozenburg, Kraantje Pappie was raised in Groningen, having spent some time living in Haarlem as a youth due to his successful Judo career. He was the host of the Dutch television show \"The Next MC\" on channel BNN. He is also a regular on \"De Social Club\" from the same network.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:1705705","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":2626186,"name":"Alex van der Zouwen"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["De Kraan","Kraantj