TM0MzAt/MTQ1NzI3ODUzNy04/Mjk3LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Sister label of [l=H2OH Recordings].\r\n\r\nTricked Out Recordings was launched in 1995 by Omar Santana in New York City, releasing it's own brand of true school hardcore flava. The Label has built up a strong reputation for itself with an arsenal of artists that includes the likes of Omar Santana, 3 da Hard Way, The Thundergods, Innerchild, The Scrumbleheads, DJ Jokey & Da Predator. It was such a success that a sister label by the name of H2OH Recordings was brought into operation in late 1996 to concentrate and add even greater ammunition to the audio warfare in breaks - setting the agenda for the Hard Hop & Breakbeat sound in America. With artists skilled in the trade of cut-up beats and sounds such as The Dark Side of the Shroom, Hard Hop Heathen & Wizard of Oh.\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:3430","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/3430-Tricked-Out-Recordings","type":"label","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/label/563192/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"563192","image":"https://i.discogs.com/CL5cKHcxew1hvvk1hRnxOevk12XwEsFXxZMRxY0Y-_A/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:450/w:450/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTU2MzE5/Mi0xNjEyNzI5OTk4/LTMxMTYucG5n.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/d7XLK3ngz65iOlp-nlP_Vp0-qWM_XGm2XQoGn8pxlbE/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTU2MzE5/Mi0xNjEyNzI5OTk4/LTMxMTYucG5n.jpeg","profile":"Home of [a1638200] releases\r\n\r\nFor bootlegs use [l3579025].","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:563192","relations":{"parentLabel":{"id":3291312,"name":"ESGN, LLC"},"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/563192-ESGN","type":"label","urls":["https://www.esgnrecords.com/"]}},"/api/discogs/release/11110459":{"cached":true,"release":{"artists":[{"id":null,"name":"Fujiya & Miyagi"}],"formats":[],"genres":["Electronic","Rock"]